load @term/seed/code/structure/field
  find field

load @term/seed/code/structure/set
  find set

load @term/seed/code/structure/function/binary
  find binary-function

load @term/seed/code/structure/function/unary
  find unary-function

# A composition algebra: an algebra over a field carrying a norm that multiplies through the product, so the norm of a product is the product of the norms. The norm is the length that never lies, and demanding it multiply is demanding that combining lose nothing, the reversibility condition. By Hurwitz there are only four, the reals, complex numbers, quaternions, and octonions.
form composition-algebra
  link field, like field
  link set, like set
  link multiply, like binary-function
  link conjugation, like unary-function
  link norm, like unary-function
